### 1) Deep insert: create a call AND its berth allocation in one request
POST http://localhost:4004/admin/VesselCalls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callNumber": "VC-2026-0005",
  "vessel_ID": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
  "voyageNumber": "AS19",
  "shippingLine_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "agent_ID": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "eta": "2026-11-18T02:00:00Z",
  "etd": "2026-11-19T14:00:00Z",
  "berthAllocations": [
    {
      "berth_ID": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "fromTime": "2026-11-18T02:00:00Z",
      "toTime": "2026-11-19T14:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}

